{"ID":"20240513082946-8d0akux","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513082946-8d0akux","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513082946-8d0akux\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175640-zy41lde\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175640-zy41lde\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513175640-zy41lde\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:194\u0026#125;","title":"343","type":"doc","updated":"20240515110637"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513175640-zy41lde","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 699px;","id":"20240513175640-zy41lde","updated":"20240515110637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"240-1 W, HY"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1953(55) / 普通"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5/21/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n1.)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳鳴，倦怠，背痛，便祕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"時有頭昏，偶有噁心。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1.)睡眠：\n2.)大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"祕，很嚴重，不難過(寒實便祕)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.)小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃，量不多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4.)胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5.)口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"還好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.)身："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"背痛，項被強(表症)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.)手足：\n8.)汗出："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9.)精神："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嗜眠(少陰症)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒實"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n1.)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子3錢，細辛2錢，大黃4錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(強腎陽，溫裡陽溫小腸，去實排便)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛根5錢 ，麻黃3錢，桂枝4錢，白芍4錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(升津解後項強，開天陽宣肺發表，強心陽解肌達四肢，酸收斂陰血，一桂一芍調和陰陽加強循環)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生薑2片 ，大棗10枚，炙甘草3錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(激發胃陽，補腸胃津液，強胸陽解宿食毒)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"共1付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗煮3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"飯前服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.) 同上方  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"100caps "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三餐飯前各八顆"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1.) 裡寒就是心臟的博動力量不夠，心臟博動產生的熱不夠，心火不夠。若此裡寒不除，則病因不除，當初會得乳癌也就是因為如此。就是因為心臟的博動力量不夠，所以奶水才無法完全的下達子宮成為月經排出來，如此淤積日久才會造成乳癌的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2.) 當心火足，小腸溫度增加，月經自然會正常，而子宮裡的淤積就會通通的排出來。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}